    "A 5-hour window with no reported quota shows a dash and is left out of the provider percent. A reported 0% used shows 100% remaining, with no reset time unless one was reported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A 5-hour window with no reported quota shows a dash and is left out of the provider percent. A reported 0% used shows 100% remaining, with no reset time unless one was reported."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gdy brakuje danych o limicie 5-godzinnym, widzisz kreskę. Tego okna nie uwzględniamy w procencie dostawcy. Zgłoszone zużycie 0% oznacza 100% pozostałego limitu. Czas resetu pokazujemy tylko wtedy, gdy go podano."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A client key (from access.api-keys) shows models and, on servers that offer /v1/fleet/limits, quota bars. It cannot change anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A client key (from access.api-keys) shows models and, on servers that offer /v1/fleet/limits, quota bars. It cannot change anything."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klucz klienta (z access.api-keys) pokazuje modele, a na serwerach z /v1/fleet/limits także paski limitów. Nie pozwala niczego zmieniać."
          }
        }
      }
    },
