    "Provider percent: what the provider's accounts have left in a window, on a 0 to 100 scale, as the management panel shows it. When every Claude account's plan is known, the average is weighted by plan: Max 20x counts 20, Max 5x counts 5, Pro counts 1. It covers enabled accounts that have not ended and report that window; the caption says how many of the provider's accounts that is. A window whose reset has passed counts as full.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Provider percent: what the provider's accounts have left in a window, on a 0 to 100 scale, as the management panel shows it. When every Claude account's plan is known, the average is weighted by plan: Max 20x counts 20, Max 5x counts 5, Pro counts 1. It covers enabled accounts that have not ended and report that window; the caption says how many of the provider's accounts that is. A window whose reset has passed counts as full."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Procent dostawcy: ile zostało kontom dostawcy w danym oknie, w skali od 0 do 100, tak jak pokazuje to panel zarządzania. Gdy znany jest plan każdego konta Claude, średnia jest ważona planem: Max 20x liczy się 20 razy, Max 5x 5 razy, Pro raz. Obejmuje włączone konta, które się nie zakończyły i zgłaszają to okno; podpis mówi, ile to kont dostawcy. Okno, którego czas odnowienia minął, liczy się jako pełne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Provider refresh failed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Provider refresh failed: %@"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
