    "Proxy Gauge": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proxy Gauge"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proxy Gauge"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Proxy Gauge asks your server to contact each provider with the account's own sign-in, the same requests the management panel sends for Refresh quota. The server does not keep the answers; this device does.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proxy Gauge asks your server to contact each provider with the account's own sign-in, the same requests the management panel sends for Refresh quota. The server does not keep the answers; this device does."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proxy Gauge prosi Twój serwer o kontakt z każdym dostawcą przy użyciu logowania danego konta, tymi samymi zapytaniami, które panel zarządzania wysyła przy „Refresh quota”. Serwer nie przechowuje odpowiedzi, przechowuje je to urządzenie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Proxy Gauge never reads or shows client key values. Servers that publish client-key policies also show how many keys are configured.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proxy Gauge never reads or shows client key values. Servers that publish client-key policies also show how many keys are configured."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proxy Gauge nigdy nie odczytuje ani nie pokazuje wartości kluczy klientów. Serwery, które udostępniają zasady kluczy klientów, pokazują też, ile kluczy skonfigurowano."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Proxy Gauge refreshes only the screen you are looking at, and only while the app is open. It reads what the proxy already knows; asking the providers directly is the separate setting below. With automatic refresh off for a server, the app, the menu bar and the widget do not refresh it on their own: the widget shows the last saved values with their age, and refreshing by hand always works.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proxy Gauge refreshes only the screen you are looking at, and only while the app is open. It reads what the proxy already knows; asking the providers directly is the separate setting below. With automatic refresh off for a server, the app, the menu bar and the widget do not refresh it on their own: the widget shows the last saved values with their age, and refreshing by hand always works."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proxy Gauge odświeża tylko oglądany ekran i tylko wtedy, gdy aplikacja jest otwarta. Odczytuje to, co proxy już wie; pytanie dostawców wprost to osobne ustawienie poniżej. Gdy automatyczne odświeżanie serwera jest wyłączone, aplikacja, pasek menu i widżet nie odświeżają go same: widżet pokazuje ostatnie zapisane wartości z ich wiekiem, a ręczne odświeżanie zawsze działa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
