            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Serwer i jego klucz zostaną usunięte z tego urządzenia. Na serwerze nic się nie zmieni."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server did not report a Google Cloud project for this account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server did not report a Google Cloud project for this account."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Serwer nie podał projektu Google Cloud dla tego konta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server did not report a configuration version, so this write is unconditional: if someone changed the routing strategy on the server since it was read here, their change is overwritten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server did not report a configuration version, so this write is unconditional: if someone changed the routing strategy on the server since it was read here, their change is overwritten."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Serwer nie podał wersji konfiguracji, więc ten zapis jest bezwarunkowy: jeśli ktoś zmienił strategię routingu na serwerze, odkąd została tu odczytana, jego zmiana zostanie nadpisana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server did not report an auth index for this account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server did not report an auth index for this account."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Serwer nie podał indeksu uwierzytelnienia (auth index) dla tego konta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server does not offer this endpoint (HTTP 404). Management may be disabled or the address may include the wrong path.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server does not offer this endpoint (HTTP 404). Management may be disabled or the address may include the wrong path."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Serwer nie udostępnia tego adresu (HTTP 404). Zarządzanie może być wyłączone albo adres zawiera złą ścieżkę."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server has temporarily blocked this network address after too many failed key attempts from it, possibly by another client. It accepts keys again at %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server has temporarily blocked this network address after too many failed key attempts from it, possibly by another client. It accepts keys again at %@."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Serwer tymczasowo zablokował ten adres sieciowy po zbyt wielu nieudanych próbach klucza z niego, być może z innego klienta. Ponownie przyjmie klucze o %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server has temporarily blocked this network address after too many failed key attempts from it, possibly by another client. Try again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server has temporarily blocked this network address after too many failed key attempts from it, possibly by another client. Try again later."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Serwer tymczasowo zablokował ten adres sieciowy po zbyt wielu nieudanych próbach klucza z niego, być może z innego klienta. Spróbuj ponownie później."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server has temporarily blocked this network address. Open Proxy Gauge to retry later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server has temporarily blocked this network address. Open Proxy Gauge to retry later."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Serwer tymczasowo zablokował ten adres sieciowy. Otwórz Proxy Gauge, aby spróbować później."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server lists no models.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server lists no models."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Serwer nie podaje żadnych modeli."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server rejected the key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server rejected the key."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Serwer odrzucił klucz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server rejected the key. Open Proxy Gauge to fix it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server rejected the key. Open Proxy Gauge to fix it."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
