            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Serwer odrzucił klucz. Otwórz Proxy Gauge, aby go poprawić."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server rejected the key: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server rejected the key: %@"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Serwer odrzucił klucz: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server reported a conflict: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server reported a conflict: %@"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Serwer zgłosił konflikt: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server was not deleted": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server was not deleted"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Serwer nie został usunięty"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server's config file does not set a routing strategy, so the proxy uses its default, round robin. Choosing one writes it to the config file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server's config file does not set a routing strategy, so the proxy uses its default, round robin. Choosing one writes it to the config file."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plik konfiguracyjny serwera nie ustawia strategii routingu, więc proxy używa domyślnej: po kolei. Wybór strategii zapisze ją w pliku konfiguracyjnym."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This provider has not reported quota headers yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This provider has not reported quota headers yet."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ten dostawca nie przesłał jeszcze nagłówków limitów."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This provider uses unofficial Google endpoints and needs approval.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This provider uses unofficial Google endpoints and needs approval."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ten dostawca używa nieoficjalnych adresów API Google i wymaga zgody."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server answered 404 for /v1/fleet/limits, so it does not share quota with client keys. Stock CLIProxyAPI does not have this endpoint. The model list still works; for quotas, add the server with its management key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This server answered 404 for /v1/fleet/limits, so it does not share quota with client keys. Stock CLIProxyAPI does not have this endpoint. The model list still works; for quotas, add the server with its management key."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ten serwer odpowiedział 404 na /v1/fleet/limits, więc nie udostępnia limitów kluczom klientów. Standardowe CLIProxyAPI nie ma tego adresu. Lista modeli nadal działa; aby widzieć limity, dodaj serwer z kluczem zarządzania."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server does not expose its routing strategy through the v8 management API.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This server does not expose its routing strategy through the v8 management API."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ten serwer nie udostępnia strategii routingu przez API zarządzania v8."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server does not keep a token report. Stock CLIProxyAPI only exposes a one-shot usage queue, which Proxy Gauge leaves alone so it does not take records from other tools.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This server does not keep a token report. Stock CLIProxyAPI only exposes a one-shot usage queue, which Proxy Gauge leaves alone so it does not take records from other tools."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ten serwer nie prowadzi raportu tokenów. Standardowe CLIProxyAPI udostępnia tylko jednorazową kolejkę użycia, której Proxy Gauge nie rusza, żeby nie zabierać wpisów innym narzędziom."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server does not route with use-or-lose, so the cards keep the list order.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This server does not route with use-or-lose, so the cards keep the list order."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ten serwer nie używa strategii use-or-lose, więc karty zostają w kolejności listy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server shares no quota with client keys.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This server shares no quota with client keys."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
