    "Usable now and blocked, in provider details: the share of that quota on accounts that can take requests right now. Quota on an account in cooldown, with another window at its limit, or waiting for a new sign-in is blocked, with how much of it comes back first and when.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usable now and blocked, in provider details: the share of that quota on accounts that can take requests right now. Quota on an account in cooldown, with another window at its limit, or waiting for a new sign-in is blocked, with how much of it comes back first and when."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dostępne teraz i zablokowane, w szczegółach dostawcy: część tego limitu na kontach, które mogą teraz przyjmować zapytania. Limit konta wstrzymanego, z innym oknem na limicie albo czekającego na ponowne logowanie jest zablokowany, z tym, ile z niego wraca najpierw i kiedy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
